5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We must ensure the new service isn't vulnerable to external factors. I want to check the logistics and funding stability first.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I agree! We should make sure everyone can actually reach the services, no matter where they live. Let's look at accessibility!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"It is not just about the amount of money, but how it is structured. We must avoid the usual second-year budget shortfall.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Everyone is so focused on the future! Why don't we look at what we've already tried? I hate seeing us repeat old mistakes.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I just... I hope we don't make the staff too busy. I want to see if we have the right people to help.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, that is a fair point. I will look into the grant terms and the road closures to see where we are most fragile.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, you're right! But if we move services, we need to know about the bus links in the outer wards. That's so important!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I will examine the endowment and the running lines from last year. I want to see where the leak in the budget occurs.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I'm going to dig into the archives. Those two programmes from six years ago probably have all the answers we're pretending to seek.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I'll check the volunteer register and the tool certification. I just want to be sure we can actually do it.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll also check the attendance sheets from former outreach stops. I want to see who we've been missing!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,pass,George,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"I'll also check the attendance sheets. I want to see if the ""failures"" were actually failures or just poorly recorded.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll also look at the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use... to see when people actually need us.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
