60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option D is out. The road closures and bus failures make it too unreliable. We cannot build a service on a broken road.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm sad about the mobile branch, but @Ryuji is right. Option A is great because it uses partner organizations in the community!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,"Option A is the most fiscally sound. It leverages existing spaces, meaning we don't hit a wall with running costs in year two.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Option A is basically the partner-run groups I found in the records. It's a proven model. Why would we pick anything else?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option A... since it's coordinated with partners, the facilitators do the hard work. The staff just... coordinate. That's manageable.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,Option B and C are too centralized. They don't solve the accessibility problem for the outer wards that @Yumi mentioned.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,Exactly! Option A brings the library's spirit to the people. It's so positive and inclusive! I love it!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,It is the only one that doesn't create a long-term financial liability for the main branch's operating budget.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,It's also the only one that doesn't ignore the fact that we've already seen this work. Let's just do it.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. Option A doesn't require the specialized tool certifications that Option C would. It's safer for everyone.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am satisfied with Option A. It minimizes external dependencies and distributes the risk across multiple partners.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm so happy we found a way to reach everyone! Option A is definitely the best choice for the community!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,I believe we have reached a calm and logical conclusion. Option A is sustainable and equitable.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,It's about time. I'm just glad I didn't have to spend the whole meeting explaining why archives matter.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I'm okay with this. It feels like a plan that won't make people too tired.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
